{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB冠軍日前以火紅長裙現身馬場引發熱烈討論，更被網民驚訝外貌「撞樣蔡天鳳」，又被報導年薪80萬，面對外界對 …</p><p></p>\n<p>前TVB冠軍日前以火紅長裙現身馬場引發熱烈討論，更被網民驚訝外貌「撞樣蔡天鳳」，又被報導年薪80萬，面對外界對其金融事業與外貌連番質疑，她大方於社交平台發表中英雙語帖文澄清。 </p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944536093729740_10477665046af53069bfd9c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-12 上午11.06.11.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944536093729740_10477665046af53069bfd9c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gloria Rong分享病住開工的照片， 驛馬星動 忙於奔波港澳與內地緊密行程Business Trip，唯有撐住周圍飛。（圖片來源：Gloria Rong）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>戎瑀發雙語帖文反擊年賺80萬傳聞</h2>\n<p>曾經參加過無綫舉辦的《澳洲華裔小姐競選》，當時她得到了「TVB墨爾本華裔小姐冠軍」和「TVB華裔小姐澳洲亞軍」的戎瑀（Gloria Rong）透過社交平台發表長文，澄清被誤傳年收入僅得80的報導，直指該數字嚴重低估她每日高強度工作付出。她幽默地反駁：<b><strong>「80萬？！全香港嘅媒體兄弟姊妹，真係太小看我每日掉嘅頭髮喇！」</strong></b></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361195714736_20796358746af5306c7693c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gloria_rongyu_1669275839_2978424071532730543_593409983 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361195714736_20796358746af5306c7693c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2022年宣布第二個碩士畢業，十年的留學生涯正式告一段落。（圖片來源：Gloria Rong）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2><b><strong>反駁走捷徑流言 轉貼好友支持DM</strong></b></h2>\n<p>她呼籲各界下次撰寫報道前務必做好盡職調查核實數據，同時強烈反駁走捷徑流言，強調：<b><strong>「如果真係圖捷徑，當年就唔使啃咁多書，現在亦唔使咁拼命做金融啦！」</strong></b>她表明一直視香港金融界優秀女性為偶像。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361325185963_3021582556af5306d8f610.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-12 上午11.06.32.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361325185963_3021582556af5306d8f610.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gloria的九頭身造型獲廣泛報導，卻對 80萬年薪一事感到意難平。（圖片來源：Gloria Rong）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361384068746_310195096af5306e248e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"pa95-z5ZTF8d2GlBUErnuXJnW0F6l9OKwmkSSMJpEkg.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361384068746_310195096af5306e248e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「年收入80萬」的消息來自早年街頭訪問，不過當事人今時唔同往日 ——「呢個數字真係嚴重“低估”咗我每日高強度工作嘅付出同掉嘅頭髮量喇！下次寫報道之前，拜託幫手做下 Due Diligence核實真實數據，唔好幫我嘅努力打折呀～」（圖片來源：小紅書街訪）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>前華姐冠軍親自回擊「撞樣蔡天鳳」抨擊</h2>\n<p>針對網上指她在馬場露面「撞樣蔡天鳳」的評論，她展現出極強心理質素並作出統一答覆。她引用「做人最緊要靠自己」作為核心理念回應負面評論，重申目前只會專注自身工作與好好生活。她表示會將媒體拍攝高畫質靚相全部收下，揚言要繼續向同行女性看齊並「做自己最大嘅靠山」。她於文末再次感謝大眾對事件關注。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361815579283_1807819116af5307287f97.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gloria_rongyu_1794137762_4025841340935212256_593409983 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361815579283_1807819116af5307287f97.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>現身馬場（圖片來源：Gloria Wong ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179423380705349224_9182721196af1d5cf75040.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179423380705349224_9182721196af1d5cf75040.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Gloria Rong IG ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361979531625_5769787806af5307427db9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gloria_rongyu_1686054535_3119173979995796848_593409983 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445361979531625_5769787806af5307427db9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Gloria Wong ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>港大碩士曾演《初戀那件小事》</h2>\n<p>回顧這位九頭身美女背景，戎瑀曾奪得電視台舉辦墨爾本華裔小姐冠軍及華裔小姐澳洲亞軍殊榮。當年她未有留在香港娛樂圈發展，反而北上參與內地劇集《初戀那件小事》與《完美証據》拍攝工作。擁有香港大學金融系碩士學歷的她，早前接受訪問時親自拆解棄影從商真相，指出金融業上升空間與潛力遠比演藝圈龐大，最終決定發揮專長轉職成為個人理財顧問。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362118072210_3046038146af530759c71c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gloria_rongyu_1779352950_3901816984052182281_593409983 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362118072210_3046038146af530759c71c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362336920557_6593749246af53077b854e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gloria_rongyu_1779352950_3901816977098214960_593409983 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362336920557_6593749246af53077b854e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Gloria Wong ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民激讚火辣造型登時代雜誌</h2>\n<p>事件起因源於11月8日舉行的莎莎婦女銀袋日，戎瑀當日以一襲火辣辣紅色喱士長裙亮相馬場，超高質素打扮迅速在網絡上引發極大迴響。大批網民對其造型給予極高評價，紛紛湧入留言區大讚「太辣啦」及「Super elegant dear」。更有支持者認為其驚艷打扮足以登上國際雜誌，直接留言指「封面嗰張真係Time Magazine封面」，相關照片至今仍在多個社交群組瘋傳。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%88%8e%e7%91%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">戎瑀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%90%86%e8%b2%a1%e9%a1%a7%e5%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理財顧問</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%81%b8%e7%be%8e%e5%86%a0%e8%bb%8d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">選美冠軍</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540817\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:43:53.460906+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1684,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:20:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:27.918979+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:27.918979+00:00","content_hash":"6d5885546900c746be5263ea746971cc0511b9c57a0f81b0dc1853c441716e17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}